.DS_Store

# Signing bridge for the Windows GnuPG keyring (scratch space).
/.tmp/

# Sandbox toolchain: workspace-local Rust toolchain and the Playwright browser
# cache. Dev-only.
.toolchain/

# Node dev dependencies (playwright, for scripts/screenshot.mjs).
node_modules/

# Frontend build outputs. `cargo build` regenerates all of these (see build.rs):
# the single-file wizard artifact is written to OUT_DIR and embedded with
# include_str!, and the fallback dictionaries are generated from locales/*.json.
# They live outside web/src on purpose — a build output inside a watched source
# directory would invalidate its own watch set and rebuild forever.
/web/wizard.html
/web/.generated/
/web/.vite-out/
